  "assumptions": [
    "Callbacks are successfully loaded, reached and invoked exactly once per successful craft.",
    "All selected resources are counted as whole inventory items; stations are represented as conserved catalysts.",
    "One of each alternative station type suffices; differences in access or behavior between alternatives are not modeled.",
    "18 raw cotton and 3 spindles are scenario inputs, not measured player inventory or upstream default values.",
    "One simulator tick is one scheduling pass in process_cotton, spin_cotton, weave_cotton order, with at most one firing per process.",
    "Recipe time fields 15/15/1000 are recorded as source facts but are not modeled as duration or assumed to be seconds.",
    "No acquisition, player travel, skill progression, recipes outside this chain, station setup, callback failure or multiplayer race is simulated."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Static reading of selected declarations and Lua functions does not prove in-game execution or full implementation equivalence.",
    "Model results cannot establish interest, economy-wide balance or an exploit in the game.",
    "The working-stock threshold applies only with no initial intermediate stock and no external spindle/thread supply.",
    "No participant data or real game runtime measurements were collected for this pilot."
  ]
